# Record with: vhs assets/demo.tape (signed in to Vin)
# Run it from a fresh clone so Vin only sees tracked files.
Output assets/demo.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Show

Type "vin" Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "In three short bullet points, explain how this project is organized." Sleep 500ms Enter
Wait+Screen@180s /Worked for/
Sleep 4s
